		Long: `Completely remove a profile content from your hosts file.
It cannot be undone unless you have a backup and restore it.

If you want to remove a profile but would like to use it later,
use 'hosts disable' instead.`,
		Usage:       "[profiles] [flags]",
		Aliases:     []string{"rm"},
		AliasUsage:  "[profiles] [flags]",
		LocalFlags:  local,
		GlobalFlags: globalCopy(global),
		Run:         runRemove,
	}
	cmd.SubCommands = []*Command{buildRemoveDomains(global)}
	return cmd
